OL,3,GNEWSAPoliticians approve new affordable
OL,4,Ahousing sites                          
OL,6,FNew sites for affordable homes in      
OL,7,FGuernsey have been approved as part of 
OL,8,Fthe review by the Development and      
OL,9,FPlanning Authority (DPA) of the Island 
OL,10,FDevelopment Plan.                      
OL,12,FThe proposals aim to provide 267 new   
OL,13,Fhomes.                                 
OL,15,FSites include Les Caches farm in St    
OL,16,FPierre Du Bois, land at Sandy Hook in  
OL,17,FSt Sampson, and the Whispers Vinery in 
OL,18,FCastel - which was advised against     
OL,19,Fbeing used by an independent planning  
OL,20,Finspector.                             
