OL,3,GNEWSAPoliticians approve new affordable
OL,4,Ahousing sites                          
OL,6,FPresident of the Committee for Housing 
OL,7,FSteve Williams said: "There are some   
OL,8,Fpeople who oppose certain sites, but   
OL,9,Fwe've got to think about the wider     
OL,10,Fpublic here."                          
